            "avatar": "shopify:\/\/shop_images\/R2_48d7719a-9cde-4402-a6cf-be740ae10b61.jpg",
            "info": "",
            "quote": "So I bought it only a week ago and let me tell you I see hugeeeeeee improvement!!!! My front leg has maybe 5% of cellulite left, only when I squeeze! In the back of the leg I see 60% gone!!!! Also I work on my boyfriend for water retention and it went down by 50% from first treatment.",
