            "author": "~ Lure customer",
            "avatar": "shopify:\/\/shop_images\/R3.jpg",
            "info": "",
            "quote": "I was looking for something to help have more regular bathroom moments. These do soften things up and don't cause any cramping or a sudden need to go. They have helped with more consistent number twos, and I have lost a few pounds in the 6 weeks I have been taking them.",
            "rate": 5,
