            "avatar": "shopify:\/\/shop_images\/R5.jpg",
            "info": "",
            "quote": "My daughter brought me this product. After the first night I felt a difference. It really helps with sleep, energy level and my legs feel so much better. I ordered two more packages, and I am doing the 30 days.",
