          "settings": {
            "align": "center",
            "answer_content": "<p>\"This has been a total game changer for me...<br\/>What it does is help drain the lymphatic system, which is fantastic for cellulite. So after I exfoliate with my coffee scrub, I then follow up with cupping. I apply oil as a lubricant. Then I just suction the cups to my skin and rub them along. And what this does is, it lifts the skin up and separates that layer under the skin where the fat is stuck and it kind of pulls it away. And with this lymphatic drainage is going to mobilize that fat and smooth out the skin... This has been a total game changer for me.\" ~ Victoria<\/p>",
